      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You have a much stronger metabolism than most other creatures. For every hour you spend without strenuous activity, you recover 10 hit points. This includes when you are traveling and taking Exploration Actions that do not require a substantial degree of effort. When you get restful sleep (typically 8 hours), you also regain hit points equal to twice your Constitution modifier.</span></p>"
